Luxury Clothing Database
A MySQL database project for managing a luxury clothing catalog, including product categories, brands, pricing, materials, sizes, colors, and inventory stock.

This project is designed as a structured relational database for a luxury fashion e-commerce application.	          

📌 Project Overview
The Luxury Clothing Database organizes clothing products into separate categories for Women and Men.

Each product contains:

Product ID
Category
Product name
Price
Material
Brand
Each product can have multiple variants based on:

Size
Color
Stock quantity
The database uses primary keys, foreign keys, and unique constraints to maintain data integrity.

